# Melee stamina (melee_stamina): the hero's blows at a standing bandit in Onar's open field until spent, clicks
# while spent, the wait back to a quarter, jump backs, then the weapon put away while the meter fills. The game's
# camera, so the bar over the health bar is in the frames. The look is judged by Claude from the shots.
# WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN BENCH_HOST=local
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
release all
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
wait 500
clear 3000
corner right go 0
melee-shadow setup 1h
wait 600
melee-shadow target 2
wait 600
pin WOLF 5000 90 0
wait 34
pin off
pin WOLF 5000 -90 0
wait 34
pin off
# The fixture's signpost stands between them at the wall: turn into the open field.
turn 180
pin BDT_1013_BANDIT_L 160 0 0
wait 300
still BDT_1013_BANDIT_L on
immortal BDT_1013_BANDIT_L on
watch player
cam game
ui on
wait 800
shot full

rec spend-1h
press action
tap forward
wait 700
tap forward
wait 700
tap left
wait 700
tap right
wait 700
tap forward
wait 700
tap forward
wait 700
tap forward
wait 300
shot spent
wait 400
tap forward
wait 500
tap forward
wait 500
release all
shot recovering
wait 1500
shot quarter
wait 2500
shot refilled
stop

rec jumpback
tap back
wait 600
tap back
wait 600
tap back
wait 600
tap back
wait 600
tap back
wait 300
shot jumpback
wait 1200
shot exhausted
wait 800
stop

rec sheathe
press action
tap forward
wait 700
tap forward
wait 700
release all
tap weapon
wait 600
shot sheathed
wait 3000
shot hidden
stop

# A spent NPC: a jump back with fists is refused, a step back without a weapon is not (melee_stamina_backstep;
# the bench stops if not). Last: it changes the bandit's strength and weapon.
melee-shadow stamina-backstep
wait 300
